      "date": "2025-09-10",
      "content": "The app frequently crashes or hangs while booking cabs, which makes it really frustrating, especially when I\u2019m in a hurry. The GPS tracking is unreliable\u2014it often shows the driver in the wrong location, causing unnecessary delays. Notifications are delayed or sometimes don\u2019t come at all, so I end up missing important updates about my ride.",
