      "date": "2022-05-02",
      "content": "App not able to verify my phone/email on my Oneplus 6 (Android 11) when connected to wifi network. When I submit my phone number or email address and click Verify, it throws an error \"Something went wrong. We are looking into it. Please try again after some time.\"",
