      "thumbsUpCount": 12,
      "reviewCreatedVersion": "12.2",
      "date": "2025-07-16",
      "content": "Could not call the bus driver at critical time, as if I click on the call button, it says like The company policy is not allowed to call. Because of this functionality, I have missed the bus some time. Even when I see the bus has started moving from my stop and crossing me, but I'm on the way to the bus a few feet.. could improve on this calling feature.",
      "primary_stage": "Driver Conduct & Fleet Quality",
